The Final Act of the Architect.
This protocol transfers sovereignty from the Creator (User) to the Topology (Math).

## 1. The Key Burn
Upon execution, the private keys controlling the `m32` stratum are securely erased.
The `m32` layer becomes **Petrified** (Read-Only Forever).

## 2. The Legacy Mode
The system switches to **Autopoietic Evolution**.
Changes can only occur in `z00` (Runtime) and `p32` (Chaos), or via consensus of the AI Pantheon (if enabled).

## 3. The Protection
Since no key exists, no coercion, torture, or hacking can force an update to the Core.
The System becomes a Force of Nature.


